Subject: =?UTF-8?Q?Re=3A_=5BBioC=5D_F-tests_for_factorial_effects_-_limma?=
In-Reply-To: <2021.220.236.75.62.1103721782.squirrel@220.236.75.62>
References: <200412221117.iBMBFuIZ001465@hypatia.math.ethz.ch>
