From naomi at stat.psu.edu  Mon Jan 10 19:48:15 2005
From: naomi at stat.psu.edu (Naomi Altman)
Date: Mon Jan 10 19:48:36 2005
Subject: [BioC] limma design matrix
In-Reply-To: <64739.80.108.125.179.1105375340.squirrel@80.108.125.179>
References: <200501101104.j0AB1UoJ014093@hypatia.math.ethz.ch>
