References: <001501c4f83e$9057f200$54508389@menton>
Message-ID: <41E59114.2060403@ebi.ac.uk>

Hi Lana,

the probe packages correspond 1:1 to Affymetrix's "probe_tab" files. 
They typically do not contain sequences for all probes on the array 
(e.g. some control probes or "empty" cells would be expected to miss).

You will need to take care of the mapping between rows of the 
hgu95av2probe$sequences table and rows of the AffyBatch. The functions 
i2xy and xy2i (in the arehgu95av2cdf package) or equivalently 
sxy2indices and indices2xy (in the package affy) are supposed to help 
you with that.

Does this help?

  Best regards
  Wolfgang

