> 
> ------> Cel file "filename" does not seem to be of HG-U133A type

Usually a message like this indicates that you are trying to read both 
U133A and U133B chips into the same AffyBatch, which is not going to 
work. You need to read the two chip types into two separate AffyBatches 
and then go from there.

