From zwu at jhsph.edu  Fri Jan 21 00:30:41 2005
From: zwu at jhsph.edu (Zhijin Wu)
Date: Fri Jan 21 00:30:35 2005
Subject: [BioC] gcrma / Bayes
In-Reply-To: <41EF81CD.5060109@curie.fr>
Message-ID: <Pine.GSO.4.10.10501201825520.23614-100000@athena.biostat.jhsph.edu>

The package does not provide or recommend MLE in this case. 
Only Empirical Bayes' background adjustment is implemented. You have
options of using both MM intensities and probe sequence
(type="fullmodel"), or only probe sequence(type="affinities") or only MM
intensities for background adjustment, but they are all using EB instead
of MLE.


