From sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov  Wed Jan 26 01:28:19 2005
From: sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov (Sean Davis)
Date: Wed Jan 26 01:28:49 2005
Subject: [BioC] indexing geneNames in exprs
References: <001301c50337$09bd1b40$54508389@menton>
Message-ID: <000e01c5033d$f4502a70$7d75f345@WATSON>

Lana,

To get the index, do:

which(rownames(E)=='203508_ad')

You could also do:

E['203508_at',]

to get the row of E.

Also, note that there are multiple ways of accessing data directly from an 
expression or affybatch object.

Sean

